"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Moving on. ⟪k:3⟫So as you can see, Giselle has her own fair share of baggage as "
"well, but she’s an optimistic woman, proactive about moving on. ⟪k:4⟫Hidden behind the Maid was a "
"fairly classic heroine character."
msgstr ""
